			"date": "2023-11-24T16:47:55.910Z",
			"content": "<p>Since folks are asking:</p><p>The only way to administer the test and view results is via the smartphone app. The app requires Bluetooth permissions and asks for location, first/last name, date of birth, email, gender, and address. Test results are automatically reported back to the local/state/federal government.</p><p>I’ve attached screenshot receipts.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
